// Conversion Functions
// --------------------

// `rgbToHsl`, `rgbToHsv`, `hslToRgb`, `hsvToRgb` modified from:
// <http://mjijackson.com/2008/02/rgb-to-hsl-and-rgb-to-hsv-color-model-conversion-algorithms-in-javascript>

// `rgbToRgb`
